      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scofield%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early settlers used the valley as pastures for immense herds of cattle and sheep coming from Utah Valley.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
