      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scofield%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town of Scofield sits on high ground two miles south of the oldest and largest reservoir on the Wasatch Plateau.",
